  "notes": [
    "Blackwater\u2019s surface gate is recessed into a real wall opening, with a concrete bulkhead, steel frame and service stairs behind the doors. The doors no longer stand in the middle of the room.",
    "Blackwater identification signs are mounted on their supporting wall or cabinet. Lettering faces the corridor, respects walls and receives the station lighting.",
    "The escape prompt, solo interaction and co-op host validation use the same doorway bounds. Escape is available after all three circuits restore power and the gate opens.",
    "The Reaver\u2019s recorded footsteps, deep demonic scream, black-smoke aura and improved hunter sight are retained.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Everyone in a co-op group should update."
  ],
